        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "Outstanding Work and Honest Service\nI had some issues with my truck’s rear axle and brake chamber, and [Name if you know it] did an amazing job fixing everything. You can tell he really knows his stuff—very professional, thorough, and honest about what needed to be done. As a one-man operation, he still managed to get me back on the road quickly with quality work. I highly recommend him if you want someone who takes pride in their work and treats you right.",
        "time": 1747949362,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Ananya Anand",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113658854094622422296/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJAn7duKzXk0cpeF0tS9btZTY7OfPcM_8n08i6kM1h7kkVI6A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "Great Experience and Reliable Service!\nI had an issue with the rear axle and brake system on my truck, including a bent mud flap bracket and a faulty brake chamber. The person here was professional, quick to diagnose the problem, and got me back on the road in no time. The parts used were high quality, and the workmanship was top-notch. Highly recommend this service needing truck repairs or parts. Trustworthy and efficient service!",
        "time": 1747942857,
